 "title": "【平均水深95m】なぜ浅いのに“世界屈指”の事故多発海域なのか？【北海】【ゆっくり解説】",
 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/OyfTg0AZ990/maxresdefault.webp",
 "description": "平均水深わずか94メートル。浅いのに世界屈指の事故多発海域として知られる北海。しかしその実態は意外なものでした。ニシン漁業から海上保険、株式市場の誕生まで。ヨーロッパを形作った「特別な海」の真実に迫ります。\n\n参考文献\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@valueshop0/video/7309527600429305119\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yTvDEllDq5A\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QWWe9PMuVng\n\nFamous freak wave recreated in lab mirrors Hokusai’s ‘Great Wave’\nhttps://www.ox.ac.uk/news/2019-01-23-famous-freak-wave-recreated-lab-mirrors-hokusai%E2%80%99s-%E2%80%98great-wave%E2%80%99\n\n\nMarineTraffic\nhttps://www.marinetraffic.com/en/ais/home/centerx:2.0/centery:50.9/zoom:7\n\nWang, H., Zhang, Y., & Weng, J. (2022). GIS-based analysis on the spatial patterns of global maritime accidents. Ocean Engineering, 245, 110569.\nhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0029801822000439\n\nFactors Contributing to Fatality and Injury Outcomes of Maritime Accidents: A Comparative Study of Two Accident-Prone Areas\nhttps://www.mdpi.com/2077-1312/10/12/1945\n\nImitation in European herring fisheries, c. 1550-1860\nhttps://vbn.aau.dk/ws/portalfiles/portal/229952329/IMITATION_IN_EUROPEAN_HERRING_FISHERIES_C.pdf\n\nGeneral Average and All the Rest: The Law and Economics of Early Modern Maritime Risk Mitigation\nhttps://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-04118-1_2\n\nOn governance structures and maritime conflict resolution in early modern Amsterdam:\n the case of the Chamber of Insurance and Average\nhttps://openresearch.amsterdam/image/2020/4/8/on_governance_structures_and_maritime_conflict_resolution_in_early_modern_amster.pdf\n\nLONDON STOCK EXCHAGE Our History\nhttps://www.londonstockexchange.com/discover/lseg/our-history\n\nInstitutions and Economic Growth: A Skeptical Journey Through North & Weingast (1989), with a Pit Stop in North (1990)\nhttps://static1.squarespace.com/static/5d653034873abb0001dd9df5/t/5d6ee278262b000001ae332c/1567548024992/North+%26+Weingast-+Constitutions+and+Commitment+%28Critical+Review%29.pdf\n\nWind, waves, and surface currents in the Southern Ocean: observations from the Antarctic Circumnavigation Expedition\nhttps://essd.copernicus.org/articles/13/1189/2021/\n\nThe Wave Climate of the Southern Ocean\nhttps://journals.ametsoc.org/view/journals/phoc/50/5/jpo-d-20-0031.1.xml\n\n\n【お知らせ】メンバーシップを開始しました！\nいつも応援ありがとうございます。\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
